  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **God Is Calling Me Back Home (Live in Bulgaria '25)** (1 other source): The performance included a segment of Green River by Creedence Clearwater Revival [1]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **God Is Calling Me Back Home (Live in Bulgaria '25)**: rare: 6 archived performances [5]\n- **Hog Calling Contest (Live in Bulgaria '25)**: rare: 9 archived performances [5]\n- **Most Of What I Like (Live in Bulgaria '25)**: back after 63 archived shows (375 days); rare: 10 archived performances [5]\n- **The Wheel (Live in Bulgaria '25)**: back after 65 archived shows (377 days) [5]\n- **The Silver Cord (Live in Bulgaria '25)**: rare: 13 archived performances [5]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **kglw2025-06-10.SBD.flac** (recommended): soundboard; 16 songs; 130 min [1]\n- **kglw2025-06-10**: source not stated; 16 songs; 132 min [2]\n- **kglw2025-06-10.revinylize.mix.surround**: source not stated; 16 songs; 130 min [3]\n- **kglw2025-06-10.revinylize.mix.stereo**: source not stated; 16 songs; 130 min [4]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **kglw2025-06-10.SBD.flac**: taped by Sam Joseph, Joe Santarpia, Grace Reader, Gaspard De Meulemeester; source: SBD [1]\n- **kglw2025-06-10**: taped by puffanug; transferred by puffanug; source: ADK Thor > PMD661 > 24/96 wav [2]. Also: Audio captured via ADK Thor cardioid microphones in ORTF configuration, positioned nine feet high; Signal processed through PMD661 recorder, converted to 24/96 wav, then edited in GoldWave to flac [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by KGLW.net: [King Gizzard & the Lizard Wizard setlist - 2025-06-10 Ancient Theatre, Plovdiv, Bulgaria](https://kglw.net/setlists/king-gizzard-the-lizard-wizard-june-10-2025-ancient-theatre-plovdiv-bulgaria.html) [6]",
